# MQ01Tate "Belagerung der Hexer", part 2: with Karick done the player helps Tate. Stages (TES4 numbers): 10 Merre/Porim
# send the player to Tate, 15 Tate asks for shovels (and gives MQ01TateKey01), 20 two MQ00StabileSchaufel01 found,
# 30 Branick dead and the mages attack the gate, 35 Hauptmann Bartulus's soldiers arrive and the gate is unlocked,
# 40 all five mages dead (also sets MQ01 1, MQ02 1 and MQ01Porim 10), 45 shovels handed in.

# Merre's greeting once Karick is thanked (INFO 001F35DD, Porim < 10, NQ00Karick >= 40) tells the player to help Tate and
# sets MQ01Tate 10.
case siege_merre_sends_player
talk MerreRef
hear 300 MerreRef Morten
bye
expect GetStageDone MQ01Tate 10
end

# Tate's "Aufgaben" (INFO 0000C934) sets MQ01Tate 15 and gives the key for the upper mine (MQ01TateKey01).
case siege_tate_task
walk 0000E5CF
activate 0000E5CF
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart07 == 0
walk WachsoldatTateRef
talk WachsoldatTateRef
ask "Aufgaben"
hear 300 WachsoldatTate Verst
bye
expect GetStageDone MQ01Tate 15
expect player.GetItemCount MQ01TateKey01 >= 1
end

# The shovels lie in SchattenrufMinePart06 (door 00001BCB in the world). MQ01TateScript sets stage 20 once the player
# carries two (the shovel refs have no EditorID: 001A24C9, 001A24CA).
case siege_shovels
walk 00001BCB
activate 00001BCB
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart06
walk 001A24C9
take 001A24C9
walk 001A24CA
take 001A24CA
until 300 GetStageDone MQ01Tate 20
end

# Back on the road, within 900 of Tate, a bolt kills Branick (MQ01TateScript, needs NQ00Karick 25 from karick_provoke_mage);
# 0.7 s later the mages attack the gate (stage 30) and Tate shouts "Sie kommen durch!".
case siege_mages_attack
walk 0000F003
activate 0000F003
until 600 player.GetInCell SchattenrufMinePart06 == 0
walk WachsoldatTateRef
until 1800 GetStageDone MQ01Tate 30
hear 300 WachsoldatTate Sie kommen durch
end

# Bartulus's soldiers (Malte, Kelrim, Laurus) follow him to MQ01TateStage30BartulusMarkerRef; within 2500 of it the
# script sets stage 35, sounds the horn and unlocks the mine wall gate.
case siege_gate_opens
until 3600 GetStageDone MQ01Tate 35
hear 600 WachsoldatTate Die Verst
expect MQ01TateMinenWallTorRef.GetLockLevel == 0
end

# The soldiers and Tate fight the mages; Kampfmagier05 goes for the player, so the player kills him. When all five are
# dead the script sets stage 40 (and MQ01 1, MQ02 1, MQ01Porim 10).
case siege_mages_dead
console MQ01Kampfmagier05Ref.kill
until 5400 GetStageDone MQ01Tate 40
expect GetStageDone MQ01 1
expect GetStageDone MQ02 1
expect GetStageDone MQ01Porim 10
end

# Tate's thanks: "Aufgaben" (INFO 001A4C4D) sets stage 45; MQ01TateScript then takes the two shovels.
case siege_reward
walk WachsoldatTateRef
talk WachsoldatTateRef
ask "Aufgaben"
bye
expect GetStageDone MQ01Tate 45
until 300 player.GetItemCount MQ00StabileSchaufel01 == 0
end
